# Emitted Messages

```block
site/package.json project/frameworks ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  i Biome can't find all the stylesheets that the frameworks of this package add to every page.
  
  i The rules noUndeclaredClasses, noUndeclaredCustomProperties and noUnusedClasses don't report anything in this package. This happens when a framework isn't installed, or when its configuration computes the stylesheets, for example with a function.
  
  i List these stylesheets in the css.globals option of the Biome configuration to enable the rules.
  

```

